cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Dote Whisper in academic work, please cite it using the metadata below, together with the upstream projects listed in `references`."
title: "DOTE Whisper"
abstract: >-
  DOTE Whisper is a cross-platform desktop application for on-device
  audio transcription with speaker diarization. It wraps whisper.cpp
  for speech-to-text (with word-level timestamps and confidence
  scores) and sherpa-onnx for speaker diarization, runs entirely
  locally without an internet connection or API key, and is
  designed for academic and research use cases where recordings
  cannot be uploaded to a cloud service.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Stein
    given-names: Alex
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-05-19
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/LiminalSpaces/Dote-Whisper"
url: "https://github.com/LiminalSpaces/Dote-Whisper"
keywords:
  - transcription
  - speech-to-text
  - whisper
  - whisper.cpp
  - speaker-diarization
  - sherpa-onnx
  - on-device
  - privacy-preserving
  - qualitative-research
  - electron
